# dojo — global .contextignore, symlinked to ~/.claude/.contextignore
#
# token-optimizer honours this file (gitignore-style globs). It hard-blocks
# reads of matched paths regardless of read-cache mode, so Claude never burns
# context re-reading generated or vendored files it has no reason to open.
#
# This is the GLOBAL list — keep it to things that are noise in *every* repo.
# Per-project excludes belong in that repo's own .contextignore.

# Dependency trees
**/node_modules/**
**/.venv/**
**/venv/**
**/vendor/**

# Build output
**/dist/**
**/build/**
**/.next/**
**/target/**
**/__pycache__/**

# Lockfiles (huge, near-zero signal)
**/package-lock.json
**/pnpm-lock.yaml
**/yarn.lock
**/uv.lock
**/Cargo.lock
**/poetry.lock

# Tool caches / generated graphs
**/graphify-out/**
**/.serena/cache/**
**/.omo/**
**/.git/**

# Minified / map artifacts
**/*.min.js
**/*.min.css
**/*.map
